1. **Define Your Goal:** Determine the estimated price of the home you want to buy and calculate the down payment (typically 3% to 20%). 
2. **Assess Your Cash Flow:** With an income of $125,000, your monthly gross is about $10,416. After taxes, rent ($1,720), and your auto loan payments, calculate exactly how much disposable income you have left each month.
