### 5. Automate Your Savings
To make sure you hit your goal, set up an automatic transfer from your TD Bank checking account to your dedicated down payment savings account the day after your paycheck hits. Treating your savings contribution like a mandatory monthly bill is the best way to ensure you don't accidentally spend it.

**Next Steps:**
